### The keyboard help and the glossary.

keys-title = Keyboard
words-title = The words
words-gate-term = Gate
words-gate = A decision that always goes through you: work stops until you answer.
words-chain-term = Chain
words-chain = How many steps of work, one after another, wait for this decision.
words-unblocks-term = Unblocks
words-unblocks = How many tasks can start right after your answer. In the strip they are the lit frames.
words-moviola-term = Moviola
words-moviola = The story of the projects on a timeline. The name comes from the machine used to review film.
words-dailies-term = Dailies
words-dailies = The daily review: what happened, then the questions one at a time.
words-dossier-term = Dossier
words-dossier = A project's folder, with its repo.
words-offtracker-term = Off the tracker
words-offtracker = Commitments that seem written elsewhere with no issue. They are signals, sometimes wrong.
words-orchestrator-term = Orchestrator
words-orchestrator = The agent that re-plans a project and starts the others.
words-controller-term = Controller
words-controller = The process that checks now and then whether there's anything to do, and starts the orchestrator.
words-worker-term = Worker
words-worker = An agent working on a task.
words-round-term = Round
words-round = One attempt by a worker on a task.
words-lock-term = Lock
words-lock = The sign that an orchestrator is working on a project: one at a time.
words-fallback-term = Fallback
words-fallback = The service that starts when the principal can't.
keys-close = Close
keys-g = Go to brief, dailies, moviola, console, settings
keys-jk = Next or previous item
keys-choose = Choose a memo option
keys-confirm = Confirm the choice
keys-defer = Defer
keys-discuss = Let's discuss
keys-undo = Undo the last decision, while there's time
keys-search = Find a moment
keys-moments = Previous or next moment
keys-help = This window
